OL,5,G1600 The World at War
OL,6,     FHome Fires: World War II as told
OL,7,     Fby the late Laurence Olivier. Hear
OL,8,     Fmore about life on the British
OL,9,     FHome Front, a time of gas masks,
OL,10,     Fdigging for victory and
OL,11,     Fevacuation.
OL,12,G1700 War Factories
OL,13,     FThe Story of the Machine Gun:
OL,14,     FHiram Maxim developed the world's
OL,15,     Ffirst fully automatic machine gun,
OL,16,     Fbut it weighed a whopping 136 lbs
OL,17,     F- until British company Vickers
OL,18,     Fadapted the design.
